  <book code="1CO" style="id">EN_DADT mji-x-daoaodai_Dao⋅Ao⋅Dai_ltr Thu Apr 09 2026 08:29:50 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">1 Corinthians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tah Yetx Cô-lin-tô Jenx</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Cô-lin-tô</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Co</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Cô-lin-tô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Yaz, Phao-lô, âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz zux ix, tuz sên taih ayx Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz cumh pâuz munh, cloon pănh nyăngz yâuf pez Sô-sa-tê-nêt, <verse eid="1CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />pungx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx yămz wa Cô-lin-tô dlanyh, six tuz stav đăngb yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz munh, yâuc tuz sên taih ayx đăngb zeengh munh wax đomc, yâuc phunz cloon yămz muif nomz tinc êu pănh nyăngz Zâu nyăngz manyh wax đomc munh, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, săngh stiz nyăngz Zâu yâuc săngh pănh nyăngz Zâu. <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Cloo pănh nyăngz Pha, six Zâu Tênb-Huungh, cloon Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, sađ pôz cloon peengh oonz phunz nyâuh.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Yaz wâyc nyâuh sâuf hâuđ yaz nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh max setc tiny, wâyc Nănh sađ pôz phunz nyâuh yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Wâyc yămz manf dlayc nyâuh tuz ayx phunz puv quâyx yămz Nănh, yămz coong nyăngz wac cloon pâyz nyăngz jau, <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />âyz năngđ coong tauv Zâu Jix-Tuz wax đomc zanyx manyf wac, yâuc tuz hinđ manyf six senz nyăngz yămz nyâuh cah njaf nâyx, <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />ayx tuz nyâuh max sămv laiv huungđ Singx-Lingh nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc tinyh, yâuc joomz nyâuđ zu pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz hinđ setb taih, <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Nănh six ayx phunz nyâuh tuz stâuđ tăngđ tauv tauh, yâuc ayx phunz max naih tinc nzêmh tauv pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz taih wax noib. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Zâu Tênb-Huungh six neetb stimz nyăngz, yâuc păngc Nănh nyâuh bix tuz sên taih cloon Nănh nyăngz toonz tuz tinyh tongb, six pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Six Yâuf pez lex, yaz tim pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz manyh quinb nyâuh, nyâuh muif lanh six oix zuc songc ah zâux wac coong, yămz nyâuh yâuc năngx gâyf naih phunz goib ayx sax peob, nyâuh six oix zuc hoopđ stimz tongh âyx yâuc songc ah stinz jau nyâyh. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Wâyc, yaz nyăngz yâuf pez lex, păngc Ca-lô-ê nyăngz pyau munh, nyâuh nyăngz dlayc bix tuz lănv phunz yaz, coong yămz nyâuh naih phunz goib ayx sax peob. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Yaz oix coong, yămz nyâuh muif lanh yâuc naih coong ayx nâyx, coong: “Yaz six săngh Phao-lô nyăngz,” max six coong “Yaz six săngh A-bô-lô nyăngz,” max yâuc coong “Yaz six săngh Sê-pha nyăngz,” nzof zef coong “Yaz six săngh Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Zâu Jix-Tuz bix zuc phunz goib mah? Ha Phao-lô zuc tingz jămz yămz săpc đăngc zax tayv phunz nyâuh mah? Max six nyâuh tim Phao-lô nyăngz bux ayx quaix-gâyf heh? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Yaz sâuf hâuđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh wâyc yaz max ayx quaix-gâyf phunz nyâuh laiv lanh, blătc nzuf Ca-lit-batc cloon Gai-atc, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />phunz nyâuh max naih laiv lanh hayh coong nyâuh tim yaz nyăngz bux ayx quaix-gâyf. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Yaz lauf tuz ayx quaix-gâyf phunz Sa-tê-pha-nat nyăngz pyau munh. Blătc wa, yaz max săngx tuz yaz năngx naih ayx quaix-gâyf phunz tix lanh max naih.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Wâyc Zâu Jix-Tuz max paiđ yaz ninyh ayx quaix-gâyf, six paiđ yaz ninyh nzônh Cuđ Jenx — max zâyf păngc tongb manyh nyăngz wac, wâyc phunz Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz săpc đăngc zax max zuc mangc stam.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Wâyc săpc đăngc zax gâyf gâyf yămz wax đomc zuc mêtc nyăngz munh, six numđ oongx nzongf, six yămz pănh tuz njâuv nyăngz munh, six săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz tômx jab. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Wâyc naih wac ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">“Yaz six mêtc nzuf wax đomc tongb manyh munh nyăngz tongb manyh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">nzof Yaz yâuc ayx paic nzuf wax đomc munh lemđ munh nyăngz zux ix.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Tongb manyh munh yămz laiv heh? Hođ đăngc nyăngz munh yămz laiv heh? Nâyx stâyv pob gâyf nyăngz munh yămz laiv heh? Max zây Zâu Tênb-Huungh ayx phunz nây bamh canz nyăngz tongb manyh pênx oongx ninyh nzof haz? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Wâyc zuc, bamh canz max stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz tongb manyh, songđ max pâyz tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh yămz nâyx huungđ tongb manyh, Zâu Tênb-Huungh songđ numđ nyađ nongc pănh nzaox nâyx đomc oongx nyăngz jau, nongc njâuv wax đomc zen nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Wâyc zuc, Yu-tai munh six naic wax đomc Jix caox njingc, nzof Hi-lapc munh six lov tongb manyh nyăngz jau. <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />Buz six nzônh Zâu Jix-Tuz zuc tingz jămz yămz wa săpc đăngc zax, manyf six săngh ah nomz njăuz phunz Yu-tai munh zuc tib, nzof yămz wax đomc pitc stingx munh six săngh oongx nyăngz jau. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Six, yămz tuz sên taih nyăngz munh, njinh Yu-tai munh cloon Hi-lapc munh, Zâu Jix-Tuz six săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jab, cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz tongb manyh. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh oongx nyăngz jau six năngx leemđ têx bamh munh, nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh đoonh nyăngz jau yâuc năngx njoongh têx bamh munh.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Yâuf pez lex, nyâyh mangc jađ yămz pănh tuz sên taih tauv laiv, six max naih đuungx lanh tongb manyh munh âyz nây stâyv sangc, yâuc max naih đuungx lanh naih lokc jangx nyăngz munh, lauf max naih đuungx lanh minb mâyc njăngb nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Six, Zâu Tênb-Huungh sên yămz nây stâyv sangc oongx wax đomc taih, nongc ayx phunz wax đomc tongb manyh nyăngz munh numđ nyayz, nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh yâuc sên yămz nây stâyv sangc đoonh wax đomc taih, nongc ayx phunz wax đomc munh njoongh numđ nyayz, <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Zâu Tênb-Huungh yâuc sên yămz nây bamh canz minb mâyc hav wax đomc, cloon zuc mangc stam wax đomc, cloon max naih wax đomc, phunz Nănh hayh ayx wax đomc naih pênx max naih, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />ayx phunz muif lanh munh max hayh ayx nzetx lub yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cah đangc. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Six, wâyc păngc Nănh nyâuh bix tuz yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz cah njaf, senz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih nyăngz tongb manyh, yâuc săngh peengh stimz nyăngz jau cloon đăngb zeengh nyăngz jau, cloon njâuv pôz nyăngz jau phunz pănh wax Tauh, <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />cayx năngđ, naih wac ja coong: “Laiv lanh ayx nzetx lub, six oix zuc ayx nzetx lub yămz Zâu.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Yâuf pez lex, cah đangc yaz ninyh nyâuh wa, yaz max zâyf ninyh nongc wax đomc lemđ nyăngz wac max six tongb manyh nyăngz wac coong, yămz yaz lănv phunz nyâuh tauv Zâu Tênb-Huungh pinyx vâyv wax đomc jau. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Wâyc yămz nyâuh cah njaf, yaz tingc săngh bâyf max coong tauv luungđ tinyh, blătc nzuf Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, cloon Nănh zuc tingz jămz yămz wa săpc đăngc zax. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Yaz yămz nyâuh cah njaf lôx numđ đoonh, numđ cumh nzav yâuc stinb sinx nzuf. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Yaz coong nyăngz wac cloon yaz nzaox nyăngz jau, six max nongc wax đomc lemđ gao cloon tongb manyh coong ayx tuz cuyb mungv, six nongc yămz Singx-Lingh hinđ manyf nyăngz jau cloon tômx jab, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />phunz nyâuh nyăngz zen stimz six max zâyf păngc yămz bamh munh nyăngz tongb manyh, six păngc yămz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jab.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Six yămz wax đomc clăkx clunh nyăngz munh, buz six nzaox tongb manyh nyăngz jau, yâuc max zâyf nây stâyv sangc nyăngz tongb manyh, lauf max zâyf cun nây stâyv sangc wax đomc munh nyăngz tongb manyh, senz zuc mêtc wax đomc munh. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Plănc taih, buz six nzaox Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz tongb manyh yămz pinyx vâyv nyăngz jau, senz tăng lôx noib pinyx vâyv quaix taih stâyv stipx stâyv wax đomc, yâuc tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh tingc săngh njâuh phunz pănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng, <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />nâyx đomc, six max naih laiv tauh cun nây bamh canz nyăngz munh hayh pâyz tuz, wâyc stiz năngđ coong pâyz, stiz yâuc max zoz gwăngz eeng nyăngz Zâu tingz ănz săpc đăngc zax. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Six, năngđ naih wac ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">“Mâyc max zeengx phătc nyăngz,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">bah noomh yâuc max zeengx tuz numđ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">nzof munh nyâuđ yâuc max zeengx nyâyh tauv wax đomc,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">Zâu Tênb-Huungh yâuc bênc săngh nongc phunz stăngz Nănh wax đomc munh.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nongc Zâu Singx-Lingh hinđ manyf phunz buz, wâyc Singx-Lingh zah tuz muif huungđ, njinh cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh đôz nzongf nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Wâyc naih mănv hayh pâyz tuz ah lanh munh nyăngz nyâuđ heh năngđ coong max zâyf Singx-Lingh yămz pănh cah njaf? Lauf tinyh năngđ, max naih mănv hayh pâyz tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jau, blătc nzuf Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Pănh six max stipx nây bamh canz nyăngz manđ, pănh six stipx tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih nyăngz Singx-Lingh, phunz pănh hayh pâyz tuz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh cungb stungx phunz pănh nyăngz pôz, <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />buz nzaox nâyx đomc jau, six max zâyf âyz bamh munh nyăngz tongb manyh nzaox, six âyz Singx-Lingh bux nyăngz wac nzaox, yâuc âyz Singx-Lingh pob manyf Singx-Lingh nyăngz jau. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Munh âyz nây stinb a nyăngz stimz nyâuđ, six max hayh stipx tuz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh taih wax đomc jau, wâyc yămz wax đomc munh six numđ wax đomc jau max setb laiv luungđ, nzof stiz yâuc max numđ hayh saz tuz, wâyc nâyx đomc jau six zuc âyz Singx-Lingh nzăngđ hayh zah tuz. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Naih Singx-Lingh nyăngz munh six stămđ tuz setb muif huungđ, nzof nănh yâuc cănh max zuc mănv stămđ.<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />“Wâyc naih mănv pâyz tuz Zâu nyăngz stimz nyâuđ — naih mănv cayx bux Nănh heh?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Six pănh yâuc naih Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz max hayh coong ănz nyâuh cayx năngđ âyz Singx-Lingh nyăngz munh, six cayx năngđ cay âyz stinb a nyăngz munh, yâuc cayx năngđ ah yađ steengb nyăngz munh sây jenz yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />Yaz six phunz nyâuh hopb nu max zâyf phunz nhlinc năngv, wâyc nyâuh max zeengh hayh nhlinc tuz. Wâyc, ayx tuz tauv nâyx zanyf, nyâuh lauf max zeengx hayh nhlinc tuz. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Nzof nyâuh six năngx jinh săngh âyz nây stinb a nyăngz munh. Wâyc yămz nyâuh cah njaf, yâuc năngx naih tinyh hănđ cloon tinyh nzeengz nyăngz jau, ha nâyx max zâyf nyâuh six âyz nây stinb a săngh, yâuc yămz ayx cayx năngđ stâyv sangc nyăngz munh nâyx haz? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Wâyc, nâyx lanh coong: “Yaz lêpc Phao-lô,” wax lanh lanh yâuc coong: “Yaz lêpc A-bô-lô,” ha nâyx nyâuh max zâyf săngh nây stâyv sangc nyăngz munh haz? <verse eid="1CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Ha, A-bô-lô six mănv? Nzof Phao-lô six mănv heh? Stiz six cungb săngh ayx pâuz wax đomc cuungv, nzof nyâuh yâuc păngc stiz bix zen, yâuc âyz Zâu bênc phunz mănv cănh naih mănv nyăngz phănc. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Yaz six songx, A-bô-lô six ănz womz, six Zâu Tênb-Huungh cănh ayx phunz lub taih. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Wâyc nây, songx nyăngz munh cloon ănz womz nyăngz munh, six max setb luungđ, Zâu Tênb-Huungh six ayx phunz lub taih wax Tauh. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Nzof songx nyăngz munh cloon ănz womz nyăngz munh, six tinyh năngđ, mănv yâuc cănh âyx mănv ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz bix tuz stipx sâuđ nyâyc. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Wâyc buz six săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz cumh pâuz munh, nzof nyâuh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh njayh nyăngz njăngx njingh, cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh zâyv nyăngz pyau.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh sađ pôz phunz yaz, yaz songđ njăpc coonz tay cayx năngđ ayx stangc pyây nyăngz munh nâyx, nzof pitc lanh munh yâuc păngc wa bix zâyv staox, six muif lanh munh oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh nănh zâyv staox nyăngz jau, <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />wâyc max naih mănv hayh njăpc pitc nomz coonz tay blătc nzu tuz njăpc săngh wax nomz, nây six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Nzof năngđ coong, laiv lanh nongc, sămz, nyanh, njăuz zâuz, njăngx, mađ caođ, bah gao, zâyv ănz wax nomz coonz tay, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />muif lanh munh nyăngz cumh pâuz six tuz hinđ manyf setb taih, tauv naih ah noib six tuz hinđ manyf wax đomc cumh pâuz nzuf; wâyc wax đomc cumh pâuz six tuz hinđ manyf setb taih yămz wa tâu nzuf, nzof tâu six cănh zah mangc jađ pănh muif lanh nyăngz cumh pâuz six nongc laiv huungđ zâyv. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh nyăngz cumh pâuz max zuc tâuf sac, yămz nănh zâyv nyăngz jau, wax lanh munh six tuz stipx sâuđ nyâyc; <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />năngđ coong laiv lanh nyăngz cumh pâuz zuc tâuf pu sac, wax lanh munh six zuc stâyb nzuf, nzof nănh lauf cănh tuz njâuv, six cayx năngđ cay clăngv quaix tâuf nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong nyâuh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz congx tinc nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh yâuc săngh yămz nyâuh cah njaf haz? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh ayx huđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz congx tinc, Zâu Tênb-Huungh six lauf mêtc wax tauh, wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz congx tinc six đăngb zeengh, nzof nyâuh six congx tinc.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Năngx gâyf cănh jaf pănh. Năngđ coong nyâuh naih laiv lanh numđ cayx năngđ six naih tongb manyh yămz nây stâyv sangc, wax lanh munh oix zuc ayx pênx “munh oongx”, phunz nănh hayh tuz naih tongb manyh. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Wâyc nây bamh canz nyăngz tongb manyh âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh mangc six oongx nzongf. Wâyc naih wac ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">“Nănh nongc wax đomc tongb manyh munh nyăngz tongb manyh taih ayx ploz lopb stiz.”<verse eid="1CO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />Yâuc naih ja coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">“Zâu Pâyz tuz wax đomc tongb manyh munh stuv nyăngz jau, six max săngh nongc.”<verse eid="1CO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Wâyc nây, năngx gâyf naih mănv ayx nzetx lub yămz nây bamh munh. Wâyc muif huungđ six săngh nyâuh nyăngz nzuf, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />hănđ six Phao-lô, max six A-bô-lô, max six Sê-pha, max six bamh canz, max six săngh mengc, max six tayc nyăngz jau, max six nâyx zanyf nyăngz dlayc, max six cah đangz nyăngz dlayc. Muif huungđ six săngh nyâuh nyăngz nzuf, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />nzof nyâuh six săngh Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz, nzof Zâu Jix-Tuz yâuc săngh Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Wâyc nây, muif lanh munh oix zuc mangc buz ayx cayx năngđ cay Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz pâuz cloon tuz cun jămđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh pinyx vâyv nyăngz jau wax đomc munh. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Nzof yămz, ayx cun pâuz nyăngz munh tauv laiv, six muif lanh oix zuc neetb stimz ayx. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Six yămz yaz, max cun yaz hănđ zuc nyâuh stămđ max six yămz bamh munh nyăngz stămđ stoif tinc zuc stămđ, yaz lauf max numđ săngh laix. Wâyc yaz six max cănh stămđ yaz. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Wâyc yaz cănh numđ yaz max naih luungđ stoif, nzof yaz yâuc max zâyf păngc nâyx đomc bix tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz; wâyc Zâu six stămđ yaz wax Tauh. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Wâyc nây, max zeengx tauv săngx huđ năngx gâyf stămđ toix laiv huungđ, zu tauv Zâu taih, Nănh six zoz pinyx yămz nzămc wax đomc jau setb gwăngz taih, nzof yâuc zoz tăng munh nyăngz nyâuđ nyâyh wax đomc jau setb taih nzuf. Tauv wax zanyf, laiv lanh săngh tanv cănh tuz tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh tanv.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Yâuf pez lex, nây six wâyc phunz nyâuh tuz gongx, yaz bix nongc nâyx đomc jau coong tauv yaz cloon A-bô-lô, phunz tăng buz nyâuh bix hoođ pâyz nâyx zâux wac:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 4:6">“Năngx gâyf ninyh blătc tuz ja taih nyăngz wac,”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 4:6">phunz max naih mănv hayh ayx nzetx lub, bix tim nâyx lanh nyăngz bux ninyh nzeengz cloon wax lanh. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Wâyc zuc naih mănv phunz goib nyâuh taih heh? Ha, nyâuh naih tix huungđ bix max zâyf tuz stipx taih mah? Six năngđ coong nyâuh tuz stipx nâyx, săngh laix nyâuh bix ayx nzetx lub cayx năngđ cay max zâyf tuz stipx nâyx heh? <verse eid="1CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Nyâuh six bâyf tuz caux nzuf nzof! Nyâuh yâuc tuz puv quâyx nzuf nzof! Nyâuh bâyf cănh hayh cun max zâuđ sămv tauv buz nzof, tuz mungc nyâuh senz tuz cun, phunz buz lauf tuz cloon nyâuh cun. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Wâyc yaz nyâyh taih Zâu Tênb-Huungh zoz buz taih ayx năngx đangz quaix wax đomc cumh pâuz munh, cayx năngđ nongc zuc tayx nyăngz munh nâyx. Yâuc phunz buz pênx năngx jetx nyăngz jau yămz nây bamh canz — phunz stinz munh cloon bamh munh mangc. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Buz six săngh munh oongx munh wâyc Zâu Jix-Tuz, nzof nyâuh six munh lemđ munh yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz. Buz six đoonh, nzof nyâuh six njoongh. Nzof nyâuh six tuz zanyb saix, buz six zuc phătc stanc. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Hănđ tauv nâyx zanyf, buz lauf zuc tanyđ nyâuđ sab, tanyđ nyâuđ gatb, yâuc zuz guyz quav yootz, yâuc zuc bopc, yâuc max naih tinc yămz, <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />yâuc zuc ayx zâuđ, nongc cănh nyăngz puf ayx cumh pâuz. Zuc munh mađ zaux, buz poou wac phunz; zuc munh ayx huđ ănz, buz yâuc tanyđ; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />zuc munh plongz wac ănz, buz yâuc quinb bux. Buz six cayx năngđ cay bamh canz nyăngz njămc nyav nâyx, zuc munh mangc max staox mâyc, ayx tuz tauv nâyx zanyf.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Yaz max zây ja nâyx đomc wac nongc ayx phunz nyâuh nyayz, six yaz quinb nzaox nyâuh cayx năngđ cay yaz stăngz nyăngz sây nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Max cun nyâuh hănđ naih săngh panc lanh stênx steengb yenv nyăngz munh yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz, six lauf max naih đuungx lanh pha; wâyc yaz six păngc Cuđ Jenx steengb nyâuh taih yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Năngđ nây, yaz joođ nyâuh oix zuc ayx âyz yaz nyăngz gao. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Yâuc wâyc nâyx, yaz nzăngđ paiđ Ti-mô-tai ninyh pongh nyâuh, nănh six yaz stăngz nyăngz toonz yâuc neetb stimz yămz Zâu, nănh six cănh coong nzuf yaz yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz jau bux nyâuh, âyz năngđ yaz yămz muif đoif nyăngz jiux pangx nzaox nyăngz nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Six, naih ah phanx munh yâuc nyâyh coong yaz max ninyh pongh nyâuh gôh, stiz songđ ayx lub. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Six năngđ coong Zâu oix, yaz six ninyh pongh nyâuh năngx căn, nzof yaz six zah mangc wax đomc ayx lub nyăngz munh, max zâyf cungb yămz nzetx coong nyăngz wac six mangc yămz stiz nyăngz jab. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz six max zâyf cungb yămz nzetx coong nyăngz wac, six yămz tômx jab. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Nyâuh oix luungđ heh? Oix yaz nzâyz pya ninyh pongh nyâuh, max six nzâyz tinyh stăngz cloon nyâuđ dlênc heh?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Senz nyăngz six numđ lănv coong, yămz nyâuh wa naih ayx pongz lauh nyăngz jau, nzof nâyx huungđ pongz lauh nyăngz jau njinh yămz wax đomc pitc stingx munh lôx max naih ayx năngđ nâyx — coong naih ah lanh munh cănh zoz pha nyăngz au nongc. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Nzof nyâuh yâuc năngx ayx nzetx lub, nyâuh lauf max pâyz stauh luungđ, wâyc pamf stoif năngđ nâyx nyăngz munh six zuc zoz setb nyâuh ninyh. <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Wâyc, yaz nyăngz stinb manyf max cloon nyâuh yămz six yaz nyăngz nyâuđ lauf cloon nyâuh yămz, yaz yâuc tingc ayx nâyx huungđ stoif nyăngz munh, cayx năngđ yaz jinh đangh naih minb yămz wa nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Laiv zanyf nyâuh căpx dlonf, yămz pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz manyh, cloon yaz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ, cloon pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su nyăngz tômx jab, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />bix stungx wax tauh munh phunz Sax-tanx nongc mêtc nănh nyăngz stinb a, ayx phunz nănh nyăngz mengc hoonh hayh tuz njâuv, tauv Zâu taih wax noib. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Nyâuh ayx nzetx lub nyăngz jau six max gongx ah tiny. Nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong tix cay piny hayh ayx phunz săngh tungđ văn phutx nzuf haz? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Oix zuc quanyf nzuf lôx nyăngz piny, phunz nyâuh tuz pênx săngb nyăngz văn, nongc ayx cayx năngđ cay max ănz piny nyăngz nzu nâyx. Wâyc Zâu Jix-Tuz six Pyenv Mengc Stêtz nyăngz pax jiz yuungh jenz, yâuc zuc tayx nongc ayx stanyb lanyh. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Wâyc nây, pănh oix zuc quaix stêtz, max zâyf nongc lôx nyăngz piny, yâuc max zâyf nongc ayx huđ ayx okx nyăngz piny, six nongc max ănz piny nyăngz nzu nây six nyâuđ zac cloon senz gâyf.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Yaz ja nây jenx phunz nyâuh six êu năngx gâyf cloon wax đomc pongz lauh munh ayx toic — <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />six yaz max zâyf coong yămz nây bamh canz wax đomc pongz lauh nyăngz munh, cloon mauh tax huungđ nyăngz munh, cloon jaf munh nyăngz munh, cloon ninyh congx miuc hanyh nyăngz munh wax đomc, năngđ coong nâyx, nyâuh six zuc setb nây bamh canz ninyh. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Six nâyx zanyf yaz ja phunz nyâuh six êu năngx gâyf cloon tinyh phanv laiv lanh tuz hipđ ayx yâuf pez, bix năngx ninyh ayx pongz lauh, mauh tax huungđ, congx miuc hanyh, hayh mađ munh, hopb tiu binz, max six jaf munh wax đomc ayx toic; njinh năngx gâyf cloon nâyx đomc munh songc hinh nhlinc năngv. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Wâyc yămz cungh ngwaic wax đomc munh six max nongc tauv yaz stămđ? Ha max zâyf nyâuh six hoopđ zuc stămđ yămz cah njaf wax đomc munh haz? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Nzof yămz cungh ngwaic wax đomc munh six Zâu Tênb-Huungh cănh stămđ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 5:13">“Oix zuc zoz okx nyăngz jau quanyf ninyh năngx gâyh nyâuh.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Nyâuh naih lanh cloon lanh tinyh nzeengz, săngh laix ninyh phunz max peengh stimz nyăngz munh stămđ, bix max phunz wax đomc đăngb zeengh nyăngz munh stămđ heh? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ha nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong wax đomc đăngb zeengh munh six stămđ bamh canz haz? Nzof năngđ coong bamh canz six zuc nyâuh stămđ, ha nyâuh bix max hayh stămđ tuz nâyx đomc jenz stăm nyăngz dlayc mah? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong pănh six stămđ wax đomc stinz munh haz? Năngđ nâyx, nây stâyv sangc nyăngz dlayc bix naih luungđ heh? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Năngđ nây, nyâuh naih tinyh cooux yămz nây stâyv sangc nyăngz dlayc, săngh laix nyâuh bix ninyh nongc yămz jiux pangx cah njaf max setb luungđ wax đomc munh stămđ heh? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Yaz coong ayx nâyx nongc phunz nyâuh numđ nyayz. Ha, yămz nyâuh cah njaf bix max naih mănv naih tongb manyh hayh stămđ tuz nyâuh mah? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Nyâuh lanh cloon lanh tinyh nzeengz, bix zef năngx ninyh yămz wax đomc max zen nyăngz munh cah đangc stămđ wax đomc dlayc naz? <verse eid="1CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Wâyc nây, yămz nyâuh naih tinyh nzeengz nyăngz jau, lôx săngh stoif nzof gôh. Wâyc yămz nyâuh cah njaf naih lanh cooux lanh nyăngz dlayc? Ha săngh laix bix max nođ zuc stâyb? Săngh laix bix max nođ zuc jaf? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Six, nyâuh cănh ayx max hoođ, zef năngx plănc minb, yâuc ayx nâyx ănz cănh nyăngz yâuf pez! <verse eid="1CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Ha nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong max peengh stimz nyăngz munh six max tuz stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz haz? Năngx gâyf cănh njaf pănh; tinyh phanv ayx pongz lauh nyăngz munh, paix miuc hanyh nyăngz munh, văngf munh nyăngz munh, munh pha zoongz ayx munh nzif, munh pha cănh nongc munh pha, munh nzif cănh nongc munh nzif, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />ayx stac nyăngz munh, mauh tax huungđ, tiu binz munh, mađ munh nyăngz munh cloon puv maoh nyăngz munh, six max tuz stipx Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Nzof cah đangc nyâuh lauf naih ah phanx ayx năngđ nâyx, six păngc yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz manyh, cloon pănh nyăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh, nyâuh bix tuz quanyf nzuf, săngh đăngb zeengh, yâuc tuz stunx ayx peengh stimz.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />“Muif huungđ yaz six ayx tuz,” six max zâyf muif huungđ hayh tuz gongx. “Muif huungđ yaz six ayx tuz,” six yaz max phunz laiv huungđ stayb yaz ayx nâuh. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />“Nhlinc hopb six wâyc stib, stib six wâyc nhlinc hopb,” six Zâu Tênb-Huungh mêtc njinh nâyx huungđ cloon wax huungđ nzuf. Nzof stinb a six max zâyf wâyc phunz pongz lauh nyăngz jau, six wâyc phunz Zâu, nzof Zâu six wâyc phunz stinb a. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Zâu Tênb-Huungh ayx phunz Zâu săngh taih, six lauf nongc Nănh nyăngz jab ayx phunz pănh săngh taih. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong nyâuh nyăngz stinb six Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz stinb sangc haz? Ha nâyx, pănh bix cayx nzâyz Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz stinb sangc, ninyh ayx săngh maic phăngh munh nyăngz stinb naz? Cănh mayv tuz ayx nâyx! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ha nyâuh max pâyz coong laiv lanh ninyh tac maic phăngh munh sab six cloon nănh songc ah nomz stinb haz? Wâyc naih ja coong: “Iz lanh six săngh ah nomz stinb.” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Nzof laiv lanh songc cloon Zâu six cloon Nănh songc ah stinz mengc. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Oix zuc pyenv goib pongz lauh nyăngz jau! Munh longđ nyăngz muif huungđ stoif six cungb yămz stinb a cungh ngwaic cuungv, six laiv lanh ayx pongz lauh nyăngz jau six pamf stoif cloon cănh nyăngz stinb. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ha nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong cănh nyăngz stinb six Zâu Singx-Lingh nyăngz congx tinc yămz nyâuh cah njaf haz, senz nyâuh tuz stipx tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih wax Tauh? Nzof nyâuh six max zâyf săngh nyâuh cănh nyăngz nzof, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />wâyc nyâuh tuz suc lauf nyăngz zax senz saix nzongf. Wâyc nây, oix zuc nongc cănh nyăngz stinb ayx phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh tuz gwăngz eeng.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Nzof coong tauv nyâuh ja jenx naic wax đomc jau: “Yaz nyâyh taih munh pha max nongc munh nzif six năngx gongx têx.” <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Six wâyc naih pongz lauh nyăngz jau, muif lanh munh pha oix zuc naih cănh nyăngz au, nzof muif lanh munh nzif oix zuc naih cănh nyăngz langh. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Langh six oix zuc nyunc âyz cănh nyăngz au, nzof au lauf oix zuc nyunc âyz langh ayx năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Au six max naih gâyf cun cănh nyăngz stinb, six langh cun. Lauf tinyh năngđ, langh lauf max naih gâyf cun cănh nyăngz stinb, six au cun. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Năngx gâyf lanh pyenv lanh, blătc nzuf iz lanh hoopđ nyâuđ zoz săngx huđ congv, nongc phunz nyâuh hayh nzuf stimz cloo Zâu, blătc wa oix zuc tinyh songc yămz, săngx đanyf Sax-tanx păngc yămz nyâuh max cun tuz cănh nyăngz săngx huđ bix taih stâyv nyâuh.<verse eid="1CO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Six, yaz coong ayx nâyx cayx năngđ hoopđ zuc coong, max zâyf yaz setb lanyf. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Yaz nyâyh taih, tuz mungc muif lanh munh tuz cayx năngđ yaz nâyx. Six, mănv yâuc cănh tuz mănv nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc max tinyh năngđ tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh, nâyx lanh tuz năngđ nâyx, wax lanh yâuc tuz năngđ wa. <verse eid="1CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Nzof năngx naih wax đomc max zeengx zoongz pyau nyăngz munh cloon wax đomc au qua, yaz quinb coong stiz năngđ phanv nâyx yămz, cayx năngđ yaz nâyx six năngx gongx têx. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Six năngđ coong stiz max cun tuz cănh nyăngz stinb, stiz six oix zuc zoongz pyau. Wâyc zoongz pyau six năngx gongx têx zuc pongz lauh tâuf sac. <verse eid="1CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Năngx naih wax đomc zoongz pyau nyăngz munh yaz setb lanyf — max zâyf tăng yaz, six tăng Zâu — coong au max tuz gâyh langh <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />(six năngđ coong au zuc queengx, yâuc oix zuc cănh yămz, max six zef muf hoopđ cloon cănh nyăngz langh), nzof langh lauf max tuz queengx au. <verse eid="1CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Nzof năngx yăngc nzac wax đomc yaz yâuc setb lanyf — nây six yaz, max zâyf Zâu — năngđ coong naih tix lanh yâuf pez naih au max zen Zâu, bix au lauf nyunc cloon nănh yămz, nănh six max tuz queengx au. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Năngđ coong naih tix lanh munh nzif naih langh max zen Zâu bix wax tauh langh lauf nyunc cloon nănh yămz, wax tauh au six max tuz queengx langh. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Wâyc langh max zen păngc au zen bix tuz coi nyâuđ, nzof au max zen păngc langh zen bix tuz coi nyâuđ. Năngđ max têx nyâuh nyăngz sây six max đăngb zeengh, bix nâyx zanyf stiz yâuc tuz đăngb zeengh. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Six năngđ coong max zen wax tauh cănh oix queengx, bix phanv phunz nănh queengx. Wax lanh yâuf pez max six ô stayx yâuc max zuc stayb yămz nâyx stinz jau, wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh six êu pănh peengh oonz nyăngz yămz. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Wâyc, ô stayx lex, nyâuh laiv pâyz tuz heh, săngx đanyf nyâuh zef cănh njâuv tuz nyâuh nyăngz langh hec? Nzof, Yâuf pez lex, nyâuh laiv pâyz tuz heh, săngx đanyf nyâuh zef cănh njâuv tuz nyâuh nyăngz au hec? <verse eid="1CO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Năngđ max têx, Zâu cănh jaoz phunz săngh lanh munh ayx năngđ laix, Zâu Tênb-Huungh êu pănh taih yămz ayx năngđ laix, oix zuc năngđ wa nâyx yămz. Nzof yaz tingc săngh năngđ nây nâyx nzaox yămz muif nomz jiux pangx. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Laiv lanh ayx quaix catz blătc bix tuz sên taih? Wax lanh munh six năngx gâyf ayx cayx năngđ max quaix catz. Laiv lanh max zeengx ayx quaix catz bix tuz sên taih? Wax lanh munh six max nongc ayx quaix catz. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Quaix catz six max naih luungđ, nzof max quaix catz lauf max naih luungđ, nongc sen six oix zuc ayx âyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz lanyf. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Laiv lanh yămz ayx năngđ laix bix tuz sên taih, six oix zuc yămz ayx năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Nyâuh ayx nâuh bix tuz sên taih mah? Năngx gâyf phunz nâyx huungđ ayx nyâuh plungh plănb. Six năngđ coong nyâuh naih congv tuz pungx goib taih, six oix zuc ayx pungx goib nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Wâyc ah lanh nâuh munh tuz Zâu sên taih, six pênx Zâu nyăngz pungx goib nyăngz munh. Lauf tinyh năngđ, laiv lanh ayx pungx goib nyăngz munh bix tuz Zâu sên taih six pênx Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz nâuh. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Nyâuh tuz suc lauf saix nzongf nzof; năngx gâyf ninyh ayx bamh munh nyăngz nâuh gôh. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Nyâuh laiv lanh yămz ayx năngđ laix bix tuz sên taih, six phanv njinh luh cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh yămz ayx năngđ wa nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Năngx naih wax đomc tanz stinb yămz nyăngz munh, yaz max naih Zâu nyăngz lanyf. Six tuz Zâu nyăngz pôz bix tuz pênx ah lanh săngh zen nyăngz munh, yaz coong ayx nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Wâyc cayx setb taih nyăngz zâuđ nanc, yaz nyâyh taih, năngđ coong ah lanh munh phanv nâyx cănh yămz six năngx gongx têx. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Năngđ coong nyâuh zuc stayb cloon au? Six năngx gâyf lov jau tinyh gâyh. Six năngđ coong nyâuh max zeengx zuc stayb cloon au? Six năngx gâyf lov au. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Six năngđ coong nyâuh zoz au, nyâuh six lauf max longđ stoif; nzof năngđ coong ah lanh munh sab đăngb zoz langh, nănh lauf max longđ stoif. Six, zoongz pyau nyăngz munh hayh pongh zuc đuungx huungđ stauh jau yămz nây stâyv sangc, yaz six oix nongc nyâuh tuz gâyh đutb nâyx đomc jau. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Wâyc nây, yâuf pez lex, yaz coong nâyx đomc jau bux nyâuh: Săngx huđ max naih đao gôh, tăng nâyx staox ninyh, njinh naih au nyăngz munh lauf oix zuc ayx cayx năngđ max naih nâyx; <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />laiv lanh haoh, six ayx cayx năngđ max haoh; laiv lanh nyađ, six ayx cayx năngđ max nyađ; maif nyăngz munh, six ayx cayx năngđ max naih luungđ; <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />laiv lanh nongc nây bamh canz nyăngz jax toongx, six ayx cayx năngđ max nongc; wâyc nâyx nomz bamh canz six jinh đangh quaix ninyh. <verse eid="1CO 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Nzof, yaz yâuc oix nongc nyâuh tuz max naih luungđ zenv nyâuh. Tanz stinb yămz nyăngz munh six cungb nyâyh tauv Zâu nyăngz cumh pâuz cuungv, nyâyh ayx laix nzăngđ tuz Zâu numđ nyađ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Six naih au nyăngz munh pha cungb nyâyh nây stâyv sangc nyăngz jau, nyâyh ayx laix nzăngđ tuz hoođ cănh nyăngz au, nănh songđ naih quenđ nyâuđ. Tanz stinb yămz nyăngz munh nzif cloon munh sab đăngb lauf ha, <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />cungb nyâyh tauv Zâu nyăngz cumh pâuz cuungv, nyâyh ayx laix tuz njinh nănh nyăngz stinb a cloon mengc hoonh tuz đăngb zeengh. Six zoongz pyau nyăngz munh nzif yâuc quenđ nyâuđ nây stâyv sangc nyăngz jau, nyâyh ayx laix tuz hoođ cănh nyăngz langh. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Yaz coong nâyx six wâyc phunz nyâuh tuz gongx, max zâyf stiv ploz nongc lopb nyâuh, six oix nongc tuz nzuf stimz ayx Zâu nyăngz cumh pâuz, yâuc max naih luungđ quenđ nyâuh. <verse eid="1CO 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Six năngđ coong laiv lanh numđ max săngh phunz cănh nyăngz sab đăngb yămz blătc toongv — năngđ nây wax tauh sab six oix zuc zoongz pyau — wax lanh munh phanv âyx nănh nyăngz stimz ayx. Nănh yâuc max longđ stoif; oix zuc phunz stiz zoongz pyau. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Nzof năngđ coong laiv lanh tingc nyâuđ, max numđ naih luungđ stayb, yâuc cănh âyz nănh nyăngz stimz bix yămz nyâuđ tingc săngh — nzauf cănh nyăngz sab đăngb — wax tauh munh ayx nâyx six senz toix. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Năngđ nây, zanyf sab nyăngz munh ayx lauf toix, nzof max zanyf sab nyăngz munh zef ayx năngx toix têx. <verse eid="1CO 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Langh năngx jinh săngh nyăngz săngx huđ au six zuc stayb cloon langh. Six năngđ coong langh tayc au six tuz pungx goib, oix zoz laiv lanh yâuc tuz, tinyh phanv âyz Zâu nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Six, âyz yaz nyâyh taih nănh năngđ coong phanv nâyx cănh yămz six năngx gongx têx. Nzof, yaz nyâyh taih yaz lauf naih Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Coong tauv congx miuc hanyh nyăngz tax huungđ: Pănh pâyz tuz coong pănh muif lanh six naih bănh sangz, six bănh sangz hayh ayx phunz pănh nzetx lub, nzof stăngz nyăngz jau six zâyv quef staox. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh laic nănh pâyz tuz tix huungđ, wax tauh munh six max zeengx pâyz năngđ nănh hoopđ zuc pâyz nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Six laiv lanh stăngz Zâu Tênb-Huungh, Zâu Tênb-Huungh lauf pâyz wax lanh. <verse eid="1CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Năngđ nây, coong tauv nhlinc congx miuc hanyh nyăngz tax huungđ: Pănh pâyz tuz coong nây bamh canz nyăngz miuc hanyh six max setb laiv huungđ, nzof blătc nzuf Zâu Tênb-Huungh ah Tauh six max naih laiv tauh manđ đăngb. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Manyf naih đuungx huungđ tuz hipđ manđ, yămz cah zâyc guungh max six yămz cah đi nib, cayx năngđ naih đuungx tauh “manđ” cloon đuungx tauh “zâu”, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />six yămz pănh six cungb naih ah tauh Zâu Tênb-Huungh six Pha, senz ayx coonz muif huungđ wax Tauh, nzof pănh yâuc huungv staox Nănh ninyh, lauf cungb naih ah tauh Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz, păngc Nănh bix muif huungđ tuz zuyx taih, yâuc păngc Nănh pănh bix tuz naih.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Six nâyx huungđ bănh sangz max zâyf muif lanh tuz. Wâyc naih đuungx lanh munh tăng cah đangc congx miuc hanyh quênx tauv nâyx zanyf, stiz nhlinc wax đomc tax huungđ six numđ cayx năngđ nhlinc congx miuc hanyh nyăngz tax huungđ nâyx, songđ ayx phunz stiz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ naih wâyx. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Nzof, nhlinc hopb six max ênz pănh ninyh yămz stătx Zâu Tênb-Huungh; năngđ coong max nhlinc, pănh lauf max cănh stâyb luungđ, bix năngđ coong nhlinc pănh lauf max cănh tuz luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Six nyâuh oix zuc bôngh stimz, săngx đanyf, nyâuh pungx stimz nyăngz jau bix zef ayx phunz wax đomc đoonh nyăngz munh zuc longđ. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Wâyc năngđ coong naih tix lanh phătc nyâuh naih bănh sangz nyăngz munh stâyv yămz wa miuc hanyh pyau nhlinc, ha max zâyf stiz nyâuđ đoonh nyăngz munh zef âyz nyâuh ninyh nhlinc coongx miuc hanyh nyăngz tax huungđ haz? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Năngđ nây, tăng mâyh naih bănh sangz nyăngz munh, bix ayx phunz wax lanh nyâuđ đoonh nyăngz munh zuc mêtc, senz Zâu Jix-Tuz tayc tayv nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Nzof, laiv zanyf mâyh ayx longđ cloon cănh nyăngz yâuf pez năngđ nâyx yâuc ayx phunz stiz đoonh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ zuc longđ, mâyh six longđ stoif cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Wâyc nây năngđ coong nhlinc hopb bix ayx phunz yaz nyăngz yâuf pez zuc longđ stoif, yaz six nođ stâyv quâyx max nhlinc a, phunz yaz nzăngđ max ayx bâyf yaz nyăngz yâuf pez zuc longđ stoif.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Yaz max tuz pungx goib mah? Yaz max zâyf ah lanh cumh pâuz munh haz? Yaz max zeengx tuz phătc pănh nyăngz Zâu Yê-su mah? Ha max zâyf nyâuh six yaz nyăngz cumh pâuz yămz Zâu haz? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Yaz hănđ max zâyf ayx cumh pâuz munh yămz wax đomc pitc đomc munh, six yămz nyâuh cah njaf yaz six ayx ah lanh cumh pâuz munh. Wâyc nyâuh six săngh zanyx manyf coong yaz six ah lanh cumh pâuz munh yămz Zâu. <verse eid="1CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Yaz oix coong tauv munh cooux yaz wax đomc jau: <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Ha buz bix max naih gâyf nhlinc hoopđ mah? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Ha buz bix max naih gâyf ênz ah lanh zen Zâu munh nzif taih ayx au, cayx năngđ wax đomc cumh pâuz munh cloon Zâu wax đomc yâuf cloon Sê-pha nâyx mah? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Max six cungb yaz cloon Ba-na-batc bix max naih gâyf tuz sec cumh pâuz heh? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Naih mănv ninyh ayx peengz zef năngx nhlinc pyau nyăngz năngv heh? Naih mănv songx tungh cuđ lauđ winb bix max nhlinc nănh nyăngz pyâu heh? Max six naih mănv jămđ pax jiz yuungh bix max hopb pax jiz yuungh nyăngz nu? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Yaz max zâyf cungb âyz nây stâyv sangc nyăngz munh coong nâyx đomc wac nef? Ha gâyf njanh max zâyf lauf coong ayx nâyx haz? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Wâyc naih ja yămz Mô-sê nyăngz gâyf njanh stâub coong: “Ngoongh wăngh nyuih blauh nyăngz săngx huđ năngx gâyf pongz ngoongh nyăngz nzetx.” Ha Zâu Tênb-Huungh numđ stauh phunz ngoongh wăngh mah? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Max six Nănh coong wâyc phunz pănh tuz gongx heh? Senz, nâyx đomc wac tuz ja taih six wâyc phunz pănh tuz gongx, coong njayh njingh nyăngz munh six oix zuc naih njih mungc bix njayh, nzof bopc blauh nyăngz munh six sâub sâuđ zu tuz tanb phunz nănh nyăngz phănc. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Năngđ coong buz nzaox meengc hoonh nyăngz jau phunz nyâuh, bix buz năngđ oix sâub tăng nyâuh nây stâyv sangc nyăngz tax huungđ six lauf hoođ gâyf lêc stah? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Năngđ coong pitc đomc munh lôx năngx naih gâyf nongc wax huungđ gâyf yămz nyâuh, buz six lauf naih gâyf nongc năngx đuungx têx? Six buz max nongc nâyx huungđ gâyf. Nzof, buz yâuc tanyđ muif huungđ wâyc max phunz laiv huungđ taih tăng nzez Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz Cuđ Jenx. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ha nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong laiv lanh yămz wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau ayx cumh pâuz, six lauf tuz nhlinc yămz wa bongc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pyau wax đomc tax huungđ haz, nzof laiv lanh ayx cumh pâuz yămz wa congx tinc lauf tuz yămz wa congx tinc nyăngz phănc? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Lauf tinyh năngđ Zâu nzaox coong, Laiv lanh ninyh nzônh Cuđ Jenx six păngc Cuđ Jenx yămz. <verse eid="1CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Six yaz max nongc wax đomc gâyf tiny. Nzof, yaz ja nâyx đomc wac taih yâuc max zâyf oix nongc yaz tuz wax huungđ gâyf, wâyc, yaz nođ tayc lôx năngx gongx têx phunz munh zoz yaz coong nyăngz wac taih ayx năngx jetx. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Wâyc zuc yaz nzônh Cuđ Jenx, six max naih luungđ phunz yaz numđ săngh ayx lub, wâyc yaz six zuc stayb yămz nâyx huungđ cumh pâuz. Năngđ coong yaz max ninyh nzônh Cuđ Jenx yaz senz zuc zâuđ gôh! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Năngđ coong yaz numđ nyađ ayx nâyx huungđ cumh pâuz, yaz six tuz stipx sâuđ nyâyc. Nzof năngđ coong yaz max numđ nyađ ayx, yaz lauf tuz jaoz phunz nongc ayx cumh pâuz munh nzof. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Ha nâyx, yaz nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc six luungđ heh? Nây six yămz yaz nzônh Cuđ Jenx six cungb ninyh nzônh cuungv, phunz yaz hayh ninyh nzônh Cuđ Jenx bix max zâuđ nongc tauv wax huungđ nzônh Cuđ Jenx nyăngz gâyf. <verse eid="1CO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Hănđ six tuz pungx goib gâyh đutb muif huungđ, yaz lauf cănh ayx phunz yaz săngh muif lanh munh nyăngz pâuz, phunz yaz hayh ênz tuz đuungx lanh munh taih zen. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Cloon Yu-tai munh yămz yaz six ayx cayx năngđ Yu-tai munh, phunz yaz hayh ênz tuz Yu-tai munh taih zen. Cloon yămz gâyf njanh cah đi nyăngz munh yămz, yaz lauf ayx cayx năngđ yămz gâyf njanh cah đi nâyx, hănđ six yaz max zâyf yămz gâyf njanh cah đi, phunz yaz hayh ênz tuz yămz gâyf njanh cah đi wax đomc munh taih zen. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Cloon wax đomc max naih gâyf njanh nyăngz munh yămz, yaz ayx cayx năngđ max naih gâyf njanh nyăngz munh (yâuc max zâyf coong yaz max naih Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gâyf njanh, yaz six yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz gâyf njanh cah đi), phunz yaz hayh ênz tuz wax đomc max naih gâyf njanh nyăngz munh taih zen. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Cloon wax đomc đoonh nyăngz munh yămz, yaz ayx cayx năngđ munh đoonh nâyx, phunz yaz hayh ênz tuz wax đomc đoonh nyăngz munh taih zen. Yaz yămz ayx cayx năngđ muif huungđ munh, phunz yaz hayh nongc muif huungđ zux ix njâuv tuz tix lanh munh. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Yaz ayx muif huungđ six wâyc Cuđ Jenx, Phunz yaz tuz săngh ah lanh Cuđ Jenx nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong tinyh tâu tiuv nyăngz munh six muif lanh tiuv nzuf, yâuc cungb ah lanh tuz stipx tany haz? Oix zuc tiuv cayx năngđ wa nâyx phunz nyâuh hayh tuz stipx sâuđ nyâyc. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Nzof yămz wax đomc tinyh tâu tiuv nyăngz munh, six muif lanh cănh hoođ lenz ayx tuz quênx. Stiz ayx tuz nâyx nongc phunz stiz tuz stipx hayh yootz nyăngz tany, nzof pănh tuz stipx nyăngz six max hayh yootz nyăngz tany. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Wâyc nây, yaz tiuv ayx nâyx, six max zâyf cungb tiuv cuungv, nzof yaz bopc, six max zâyf cungb bopc nzaox. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Six, yaz jaoz ayx tuz yaz nyăngz stinb a zuc buc, săngx đanyf yaz nzaox tuz munh blătc, yaz bix zef cănh zuc zoz setb.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz max oix nongc nyâuh max pâyz tuz coong, pănh nyăngz claof jex yetx stong yămz ah tungđ vănx cah đi, yetx stong tuz clăngv quaix coiđ, <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />yetx stong lêpc Mô-sê ninyh tuz ayx quaix-gâyf yămz ah tungđ vănx cloon coiđ đi, <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />yetx stong lauf tuz songc nhlinc ah huungđ yuungf meengc nyăngz nhlinc hopb, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />nzof yetx stong lauf tuz songc hopb ah huungđ yuungf mengc nyăngz womz, wâyc stiz hopb tăng ah nomz yuungf mengc njăuz lêpc stiz, nzof wax nomz njăuz six Zâu Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Six, Zâu Tênb-Huungh songđ max numđ nyađ wax đomc nyăngz ah phanx munh, wâyc nây stiz songđ zuc glinyf jămc lâyc ninyh tayc yămz wa stâyz phangz blănf. <verse eid="1CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nzof, nâyx đomc six lauf săngh ah huungđ gao nongc toon pănh, phunz pănh max ninyh ayx âyz huđ nyăngz gao cayx năngđ stiz oix ayx nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />Yâuc năngx gâyf pênx wax đomc congx miuc hanyh nyăngz munh cayx năngđ stiz ah phanx munh nâyx; wâyc naih ja coong: “Pec stingx stâyv nhlinc yâuc hopb tuz, songđ nyoongz quef ninyh nyađ.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />Pănh lauf max tuz ayx pongz lauh cayx năngđ stiz ah phanx munh ayx nâyx, bix toongx ah noib, nhlic săpc stamz tinb lanh munh zuc tayc. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />Yâuc năngx gâyf stâyv Zâu cayx năngđ stiz naih ah phanx munh stâyv Zâu bix zuc nangz tapc tayc nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />Yâuc năngx gâyf yônx cayx năngđ stiz naih ah phanx munh yônx nâyx, bix zuc hayh mêtc munh wax tauh tayx tayc. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Nâyx đomc dlayc setb taih phunz stiz six săngh ah huungđ gao, yâuc tuz ja taih nongc toon pănh, senz yămz stătx muif nzêuh nyăngz stâyz phangz đanyf nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Wâyc nây, laiv lanh nyâyh coong nănh stâuđ wăn, oix zuc năngx cayb bôngh săngx đanyf hayh glinyf. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Nyâuh pongh wax đomc stâyv nyâuđ nyăngz jau, six max naih laiv huungđ blătc bamh munh nyăngz jab; nzof, Zâu Tênb-Huungh six neetb stimz, Nănh six max phunz nyâuh pongh stâyv nyâuđ blătc nyâuh nyăngz jab, nzof yămz wax đomc stâyv nyâuđ nyăngz jau, Nănh six coib jau, phunz nyâuh hayh tanyđ tuz.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Wâyc nây, yaz stăngz nyăngz yâuf pez lex, oix zuc pyenv goib paix miuc hanyh nyăngz jau. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Yaz coong ănz nyâuh cayx năngđ cay coong ănz tongb manyh munh nâyx. Nyâuh oix zuc cănh zah mangc yaz coong nyăngz wac. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Pănh sâuf hâuđ wax nomz zan, max zâyf songc cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz samđ haz? Nzof pănh watz wax nomz nzu taih, max zâyf lauf songc cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz stinb haz? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Wâyc cungb naih ah nomz nzu cuungv, pănh hănđ đuungx lanh, six lauf cungb ah nomz stinb cuungv, wâyc pănh muif lanh songc yămz ah nomz nzu. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Phanv mangc I-sa-la-ên munh âyz nây stinb a. Max zâyf laiv lanh nhlinc congx nyăngz stanyb lanyh, six tuz songc yămz wa congx tinc nyăngz phănc haz? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Yaz coong năngđ nâyx six ayx laix? Congx miuc hanyh nyăngz tax huungđ bix naih luungđ, Nzof miuc hanyh bix setb luungđ? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Hănđ năngđ nâyx, wax đomc pitc stingx munh congx nyăngz tax huungđ six congx phunz manđ, max zâyf phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh. Nzof yaz yâuc max oix nongc nyâuh ninyh cloon wax đomc manđ songc phănc! <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Nyâuh max hayh hopb Zâu nyăngz zan bix zef ninyh hopb manđ nyăngz zan. Nyâuh yâuc max hayh songc Zâu nyăngz hinh bix zef ninyh songc manđ nyăngz hinh. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Max six pănh oix nhlef phunz Zâu numđ nhlenx? Ha pănh bix năngx njoongh têx Nănh mah?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />“Muif huungđ six naih gâyf ayx,” six max zâyf muif huungđ hayh phunz pănh tuz gongx. “Muif huungđ six naih gâyf ayx,” six max zâyf muif huungđ hayh stăngc tuz pănh. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Năngx gâyf naih mănv cungb tâuh cănh tuz gongx, six oix zuc ayx phunz pitb lanh munh tuz gongx. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Maic yămz lâyc caiz sangc nyăngz muif huungđ six phanv nhlinc, stimz nyâuđ yâuc năngx gâyf nyâyh wangb luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Wâyc “nib cloon yămz nây nib minc nyăngz muif huungđ six săngh Zâu nyăngz nzuf.” <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Năngđ coong naih tix lanh max zen nyăngz munh êu nyâuh ninyh tayđ, nyâuh yâuc oix ninyh têx, six phanv nhlinc stiz bênc taih nyăngz muif huungđ, stimz nyâuđ yâuc năngx gâyf nyâyh wangb luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Six năngđ coong naih munh coong ănz nyâuh coong: “Nâyx six congx phunz manđ nzof,” six năngx gâyf nhlinc, wâyc wax tauh munh coong phunz nyâuh pâyz, yâuc wâyc stimz nyâuđ — <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />yaz max zâyf coong tauv nyâuh cănh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ, six coong tauv wax tauh munh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ. Wâyc săngh laix yaz tuz pungx goib nyăngz jau bix zef zuc pitc lanh munh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ stămđ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Năngđ coong yaz sâuf hâuđ tuz nzăngđ nhlinc, săngh laix yaz bix năngx zuc munh coong tauv yaz sâuf hâuđ bix nhlinc wax huungđ? <verse eid="1CO 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Wâyc nây, max cun nyâuh nhlinc max six hopb, max six ayx laiv huungđ, oix zuc ayx muif huungđ phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh tuz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Năngx gâyf ayx huđ nyăngz gao phunz Yu-tai munh cloon Hi-lapc munh cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx longđ stoif, <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />cayx năngđ yaz cănh nyunc wâyc muif lanh munh ayx cumh pâuz nâyx, yaz max tâuh cănh tuz gongx, six wâyc phunz đuungx lanh munh tuz gongx, phunz stiz hayh tuz njâuv.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Oix zuc hoođ âyz yaz nyăngz gao ayx, cayx năngđ yaz âyz Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz gao ayx nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Yaz tanv nyâuh wâyc nyâuh yămz manf dlayc yâuc săngx tauv yaz, nzof nyâuh yâuc nzuf stimz nzuf nyâuđ ayx âyz yaz nzaox phunz nyâuh wax đomc jau. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Six, yaz yâuc oix nongc nyâuh pâyz tuz coong Zâu Jix-Tuz six ayx muif lanh munh pha nyăngz pyây, nzof munh pha six ayx munh nzif nyăngz pyây, nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh six ayx Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz pyây. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Muif lanh munh pha cloo Zâu max six tâuc wac, năngđ coong nongc tix huungđ plongz pyây, six ayx nyayz cănh nyăngz pyây. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Six muif lanh munh nzif cloo Zâu max six tâuc wac bix max plongz pyây, six ayx nyayz cănh nyăngz pyây. Six cayx năngđ cay zuc tâyv pyây nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Năngđ coong munh nzif max plongz pyây, nănh wănh jăpx pyây. Six munh nzif jăpx pyây max six tâyv pyây yâuc senz nyayz nzongf, năngđ nâyx nănh oix zuc plongz pyây. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />Six munh pha yâuc max hoopđ zuc plongz pyây, wâyc munh pha six nzâyz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz gwăngz eeng. Nzof, munh nzif six munh pha nyăngz gwăngz eeng. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Wâyc munh pha six max zâyf tăng munh nzif taih, six munh nzif tăng munh pha taih. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Yâuc wâyc munh pha max tuz zuyx taih wâyc munh nzif, six munh wâyc munh pha. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Wâyc nây, munh nzif oix zuc đongx njic hoouđ hinđ manyf lokc jangx yămz nănh nyăngz pyây, wâyc wax đomc stinz munh. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Năngđ nây, yămz Zâu cah njaf, munh nzif six max lanyc munh pha, munh pha yâuc max lanyc munh nzif. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Wâyc munh nzif tăng munh pha taih ayx năngđ laix, munh pha lauf tăng munh nzif steengb taih năngđ wa nâyx, six muif huungđ yâuc tăng Zâu Tênb-Huungh taih nzuf. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Nyâuh cănh oix zuc nyâyh mungv jađ: Munh nzif cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh cloo Zâu bix max plongz pyây six hoopđ max hoopđ? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Max zâyf nyâuh lauf cănh pâyz coong, năngđ coong munh pha njâuh pyây đongz đao, six cănh nyayz nănh, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />nzof munh nzif njâuh pyây đongz đao, six săngh nănh nyăngz gwăngz eeng haz? Wâyc nănh tuz sađ phunz naih pyây đongz đao cayx năngđ bah nyaic đongx plongz pyây nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Năngđ coong naih mănv oix nzeengz nâyx đomc jau, buz yâuc max ayx nâyx, nzof Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx lauf max ayx nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Six nâyx zanyf yaz coong nâyx đomc lanyf, yaz max tanv nyâuh, wâyc nyâuh căpx dlonf six max zâyf nongc ayx gongx, bix taih nongc ayx huđ. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Tah yetx, yaz numđ coong nyâuh yămz jiux pangx căpx dlonf nyăngz săngx huđ, yămz nyâuh cah njaf yâuc naih phunz goib ayx sax peob, yaz lauf zen coong nâyx đomc dlayc six senz naih. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Wâyc yămz nyâuh cah njaf senz zuc naih phunz goib taih, nongc phunz hayh tanyđ tuz stâyv nyâuđ nyăngz jau wax đomc munh, yâuc tuz hinđ manyf setb taih yămz nyâuh cah njaf. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Wâyc nây, nyâuh taih căpx dlonf yămz ah nomz tinc nyăngz săngx huđ, six max zâyf songc Zâu nyăngz hinh nhlinc nzof. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Wâyc nhlinc nyăngz săngx huđ, mănv cănh coonx nhlinc mănv nyăngz đangc; wâyc nây songđ naih ah phanx six zuc tanyđ nyâuđ sab, nzof naih ah phanx yâuc tiu binz. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Ha nyâuh max naih pyau nongc yămz wa nhlinc hopb mah? Max six nyâuh mangc stam Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx bix ayx phunz wax đomc max naih luungđ nyăngz munh nyayz heh? Yaz cayx hoopđ zuc coong ayx laix ănz nyâuh heh? Hoopđ zuc tanv nyâuh ayx nâyx đomc jau max? Yaz max tanv đêh! <verse eid="1CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Wâyc yaz tuz stipx tăng Zâu nyăngz gâyf, yaz songđ jaoz phunz nyâuh, nây six Zâu Yê-su, yămz Nănh zuc maic wax munf, songđ zoz nzuf taih, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />sâuf hâuđ tuz Nănh songđ watz taih yâuc coong: “Nây six yaz nyăngz stinb, six wâyc tayv phunz nyâuh. Oix zuc ayx năngđ nâyx wâyc săngx tauv yaz.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Lauf tinyh năngđ nhlinc nzuf tuz zef zoz nomz zan taih, yâuc coong: “Nâyx nomz zan six nongc yaz nyăngz samđ njăpc săngb nhlengc wac. Laiv zanyf nyâuh hopb nâyx nomz zan, oix zuc ayx năngđ nâyx wâyc săngx tauv yaz.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Tinyh phanv laiv zanyf nyâuh nhlinc nâyx nomz nzu, hopb nâyx nomz zan, nyâuh six coong tauv Zâu tayc nyăngz jau ayx tuz tauv Nănh taih. <verse eid="1CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Wâyc nây, tinyh phanv laiv lanh nhlinc Zâu nyăngz nzuf max six hopb Zâu nyăngz zan, bix ayx max payh six naih stoif cloon Zâu nyăngz stinb cloon Zâu nyăngz samđ. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Năngđ nây, muif lanh oix zuc cănh zah pănh mangc, nzof mănc nhlinc nzu, hopb zan. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Wâyc laiv lanh nhlinc cloon hopb bix max saz tuz Zâu nyăngz stinb, six nhlinc cloon hopb nongc tingc nănh. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Wâyc nây, yămz nyâuh cah njaf nzăngđ naih đuungx lanh zuc munz, săngh gumc, yâuc naih đuungx lanh mâyc njoomh. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Nzof năngđ coong pănh cănh zah pănh mangc, pănh six max zuc tingc stoif. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Six tauv zuc Zâu tingc stoif, pănh six zuc phađ, phunz pănh max zuc songc cloon bamh canz munh zuc tingc stoif. <verse eid="1CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Wâyc nây, yaz nyăngz yâuf pez lex, laiv zanyf căpx dlonf nongc nhlinc, six oix zuc lanh zu lanh. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh nyâuđ sab, six oix zuc yămz wa pyau nhlinc, phunz nyâuh căpx dlonf bix max zuc tingc stoif. Năngx naih pitc huungđ zu tauv laiv zanyf yaz ninyh yaz mănc coong.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Nzof coong tauv Singx-Lingh nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc, Yâuf pez lex, yaz max oix nongc nyâuh max pâyz luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Nyâuh pâyz coong yămz nyâuh năngx jinh max zeengx zen nyăngz săngx huđ, nyâuh lauf zuc hox năngđ nâyx, zuc ênz ninyh pongc wax đomc max hayh coong wac nyăngz miuc hanyh. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Wâyc nây, yaz bux phunz nyâuh pâyz coong max naih mănv păngc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz Singx-Lingh bix coong: “Yê-su hoopđ zuc zaux!”, Nzof năngđ max păngc Zâu Singx-Lingh, yâuc max naih mănv hayh nhlimc coong “Zâu Yê-su six Zâu!”.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Nzof, naih đuungx huungđ sâuđ nyâyc max tinyh năngđ, six lauf cungb songc ah tauh Singx-Lingh cuungv. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Yâuc naih đuungx huungđ cumh pâuz ayx max tinyh năngđ, six lauf songc ah tauh Zâu. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Naih đuungx huungđ cumh pâuz max tinyh năngđ, six lauf cungb songc ah tauh zâu Tênb-Huungh cuungv, senz ayx muif huungđ cumh pâuz yămz muif lanh munh wax Tauh. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Zâu Singx-Lingh tuz sađ phunz yămz muif lanh munh wâyc phunz tinyh đoih tuz gongx. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Wâyc păngc Singx-Lingh, bix nâyx lanh tuz hayh coong tongb manyh wac, nzof yâuc tăng ah tauh Singx-Lingh bix wax lanh hayh coong sting jaođ wac; <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />yâuc tăng ah tauh Singx-Lingh bix nâyx lanh tuz naih zen stimz, nzof lauf tăng ah tauh Singx-Lingh bix wax lanh yâuc tuz sâuđ nyâyc hayh zany gumc, <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />yâuc phunz nâyx lanh hayh ayx jix caox njingc; zef phunz wax lanh, hayh tâuc wac, yâuc phunz nâyx lanh hayh stămđ tuz setb manđ max six Singx-Lingh; zef phunz wax lanh, hayh coong pitc huungđ wac; zef phunz pitc lanh timb hayh phanv tuz wax đomc pitc huungđ wac. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Six lauf cungb songc ah tauh Singx-Lingh đokc ayx wax đomc muif huungđ cumh pâuz, cănh âyz Nănh nyăngz zux ix sađ phunz muif lanh tuz nyăngz yâuc max tinyh năngđ.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Wâyc cayx năngđ ah nomz stinb bix naih đuungx huungđ phănc nâyx, nzof stinb sangc nyăngz muif huungđ phănc, manyf naih đuungx, six lauf cungb songc ah nomz stinb cuungv; Zâu Jix-Tuz lauf năngđ nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Yâuc tăng ah tauh Singx-Lingh pănh muif lanh bix tuz ayx quaix-gâyf taih songc yămz ah nomz stinb, max cun Yu-tai munh max six Hi-lapc munh, ayx nâuh max six max ayx nâuh, yâuc muif lanh tuz songc ah tauh Singx-Lingh hopb. <verse eid="1CO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Wâyc stinb six max zâyf cungb naih ah huungđ phănc cuungv, six naih đuungx huungđ phănc. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Năngđ coong staux coong: “Wâyc yaz max zâyf pu, yaz six max zâyf stinb nyăngz ah huungđ,” yâuc max zâyf coong wâyc nâyx nănh bix max zâyf stinb nyăngz ah huungđ. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Nzof năngđ coong bah noomh coong: “Wâyc yaz max zâyf mâyc, yaz six max zâyf stinb nyăngz ah huungđ,” yâuc max zâyf coong wâyc nâyx nănh bix max zâyf stinb nyăngz ah huungđ. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Năngđ coong lomc stinb six mâyc nzuf, bix nongc luungđ mungv heh? Nzof năngđ coong lomc stinb six bah noomh nzuf, bix nongc luungđ homv siv heh? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Wâyc nây, Zâu Tênb-Huungh songđ bênc muif huungđ phănc yămz ah nomz stinb, ah huungđ cănh naih ah huungđ nyăngz phănc, âyz Nănh nyăngz zux ix. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Nzof năngđ coong tinyh đoih bix cungb ah huungđ phănc cuungv, bix stinb yămz laiv heh? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Wâyc nây, manyf naih đuungx huungđ phănc, six lauf cungb naih ah nomz stinb cuungv. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Nzof, mâyc max hayh coong ănz puf coong: “Yaz max sămv tauv mâyh”, max six pyây yâuc max hayh coong ănz staux coong: “Yaz max sămv tauv mâyh.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Plănc taih, yămz stinb sangc nyăngz laiv huungđ phănc năngx đoonh têx, yâuc zuc lif năngx gongx têx; <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />nzof pănh phătc stinb nyăngz laiv huungđ phănc max saix, pănh yâuc nongc nănh ayx năngx saix têx; phătc laiv huungđ phănc max quai pănh yâuc zoongz năngx nzongf têx, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />nzof laiv huungđ phănc cănh quai pănh yâuc max sămv zuc zoongz. Six Zâu Tênb-Huungh căpx stinb taih, nongc phunz wax đomc max tuz zanyb saix yâuc tuz zanyb saix, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />stinb six max hayh phunz goib, stinb sangc nyăngz phănc six tinyh đoih lanh hâuđ lênh lanh. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Năngđ coong naih ah huungđ phănc zuc munz, six lomc stinb sangc tinyh đoih tanyđ nzuf; năngđ coong naih ah huungđ phănc tuz zanyb saix, six lomc stinb sangc tuz songc numđ nyađ. <verse eid="1CO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Nzof, nyâuh six Zâu Jix-Tuz nyăngz stinb, yâuc săngh wax đomc stinb sangc nyăngz muif huungđ phănc six max tinyh năngđ. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Zâu Tênb-Huungh sên ah đomc munh taih yămz jiux pangx, tah yetx six, cumh pâuz munh, tah nyâyc six, wax đomc tâuc wac munh, tah stamz six wax đomc stênx steengb, zef ah phanx hayh ayx jix caox njingc, ah phanx tuz sâuđ nyâyc hayh zany gumc, stăngc munh, hayh cun, cloon coong wax đomc pitc huungđ wac. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Max zâyf muif lanh six cumh pâuz munh? Yâuc max zâyf muif lanh six tâuc wac munh? Max zâyf muif lanh six ayx stênx steengb? Yâuc max zâyf muif lanh hayh ayx jix caox njingc? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Max zâyf muif lanh tuz sâuđ nyâyc hayh zany gumc? Yâuc max zâyf muif lanh hayh coong pitc huungđ wac? Nzof yâuc max zâyf muif lanh hayh phanv tuz wax đomc wac? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Six oix zuc nzac jab lov wax đomc năngx gongx quaix nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc. Nzof nâyx zanyf yaz six bux phunz nyâuh pâyz tuz laiv huungđ six năngx gongx quaix nyăngz jau.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Max cun yaz hănđ hayh coong tuz guungh đi munh nyăngz muif huungđ wac cloon stinz munh nyăngz wac, bix yaz năngđ max stăngz munh, yaz six cayx năngđ ah nomz canyz buib stingb nhlangđ max six cayx năngđ tungh jemv buib nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Năngđ coong yaz tuz sâuđ nyâyc hayh tâuc wac yâuc hayh manyh pec muif huungđ pinyx vâyv nyăngz jau cloon muif huungđ bănh sangz, nzof yaz hănđ naih zen stimz lub ayx tuz êu zoongz zâyc stuyđ, bix yaz năngđ max stăngz munh, yaz six max setb luungđ tinyh. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Nzof năngđ coong yaz zoz yaz nyăngz muif huungđ jax toongx phunz munh zâuđ munh, yâuc cănh jaoz yaz nyăngz stinb phunz munh pu, bix yaz năngđ max stăngz munh, yaz six lauf max tuz luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Stăngz munh six hayh nyangc tuz yâuc dlênc, stăngz munh six max stâyx munz, stăngz munh six max ayx nzetx lub yâuc max ayx lub, <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />yâuc max ayx longđ nyăngz jau, yâuc max tâuh cănh tuz gongx, yâuc max siv totc căn, yâuc max stunx munh ayx huđ nyăngz jau, <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />yâuc max numđ nyađ huđ nyăngz jau, six numđ nyađ yămz senz gâyf; <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />stăngz munh six hayh quanyf tuz muif huungđ, zen mungc muif huungđ, yămz manf dlayc yâuc naih njih mungc, yâuc hayh tanyđ tuz muif huungđ. <verse eid="1CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Stăngz nyăngz jau max naih laiv zanyf hayh jac. Hănđ tuz sâuđ nyâyc hayh tâuc wac, stiz six lauf zuc pac; hănđ tuz sâuđ nyâyc coong pitc huungđ wac, stiz lauf zuc sec; hănđ tuz bănh sangz naih tongb manyh, stiz lauf zuc quanyf. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Wâyc pănh hoođ six cungb pâyz tuz tix cay, nzof pănh tâuc wac lauf cungb tâuc tuz tix cay. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Six tauv clăkx clunh nyăngz jau taih tauv, max clăkx clunh nyăngz jau yâuc zuc quanyf. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Yaz năngx jinh ayx munh sây nyăngz săngx huđ, yaz coong wac six cayx năngđ munh sây, yaz nyâyh lauf cayx năngđ munh sây, yaz zah mangc lauf cayx năngđ munh sây. Tauv yaz săngh munh côx, yaz quanyf wax đomc munh sây nyăngz gao. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Wâyc nâyx zanyf, pănh mangc quaix munh sây canyx six cungb phătc cay plâub plâub cuungv, six tauv wax zanyf yâuc tuz phătc minb toix minb. Nâyx zanyf yaz cungb pâyz tuz tix cay cuungv, six tauv wax zanyf yaz yâuc tuz pâyz nzuf, năngđ yaz senz pâyz tuz nzuf nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Six nâyx zanyf cungb năngx naih nây pôz huungđ: Zen stimz, njih mungc, cloon stăngz munh nyăngz jau. Nzof yămz nây pôz huungđ năngx nongc sen quaix six stăngz munh nyăngz jau.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Oix zuc lov stăngz munh nyăngz jau, yâuc oix zuc joomz nyâuđ lov wax đomc Singx-Lingh nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc, năngx nongc sen quaix six phunz nyâuh hayh tâuc wac. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Wâyc laiv lanh coong wac njingc six max zâyf cloon munh coong, six cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh coong; wâyc max naih mănv saz, six, nănh yămz Singx-Lingh bix coong pinyx vâyv nyăngz jau. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Six laiv lanh tâuc wac six coong hayh zâyv tuz munh nyăngz wac, quinb nzaox yâuc oonz tuz munh nyăngz nyâuđ. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Coong pitc huungđ wac nyăngz munh six cănh zâyv nănh, nzof tâuc wac nyăngz munh six zâyv Jiux Pangx. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Yaz oix nyâuh muif lanh hayh coong pitc huungđ wac, six yaz năngx oix têx, six nyâuh hayh tâuc wac. Tâuc wac nyăngz munh six năngx nongc sen quaix coong wac njingc nyăngz munh, năngđ naih munh phanv tuz wax đomc wac six max coong, wâyc phunz jiux pangx hayh tuz zâyv staox. <verse eid="1CO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Six, yâuf pez lex, năngđ coong nâyx zanyf yaz ninyh nyâuh wa bix coong wax đomc muif huungđ wac njingc ănz nyâuh, bix yaz yâuc max coong plongx yangh nyăngz jau, max six tongb manyh nyăngz wac, max six tâuc wac max six nzaox nyăngz wac ănz nyâuh, bix hayh stăngc tuz nyâuh laiv huungđ heh? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Hănđ six wax đomc max setb luungđ nyăngz tungh zăngc naih stingb buib — cayx năngđ blungh blex max six lanyh njămh — năngđ coong stiz nyăngz stingb bix buib tinyh năngđ, bix naih mănv hayh saz tuz coong pyom blungh blex nyăngz stingb max six quetb lanyh njămh nyăngz stingb heh? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Nzof năngđ coong pyom joongz blungh blex nyăngz stingb bix max manyf, laiv naih mănv hayh pâyz bênc săngh nongc ninyh panx peengz heh? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />Nyâuh lauf năngđ nâyx, năngđ coong nyâuh nyăngz nzetx coong nyăngz wac bix max coong tuz manyf têx, naih mănv hayh saz tuz nyâuh coong nyăngz wac heh? Wâyc nyâuh cungb coong quaix nzaox cuungv. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Yămz nây bamh canz senz naih đuungx huungđ wac nzongf, max tinyh năngđ, yâuc max naih laiv huungđ coong bix max naih âyz gâyf. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nzof, năngđ coong yaz max saz wax cuyb wac nyăngz âyz gâyf, yaz six stunx coong wac ănz yaz wax tauh six pitc stingx munh, nzof coong wac wax tauh lauf stunx yaz six pitc stingx munh. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Nyâuh lauf năngđ nâyx, wâyc nyâuh joomz nyâuđ lov Singx-Lingh nyăngz sâuđ nyâyc, wâyc nongc zâyv jiux pangx, wâyc nây oix zuc lov phunz nyâuh tuz naih muif huungđ sâuđ nyâyc. <verse eid="1CO 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Năngđ nây, coong wac njingc nyăngz munh oix zuc cloo Zâu phunz naih munh hayh pob manyf wax đomc wac. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Năngđ coong yaz nongc wac njingc cloo Zâu, six yaz nyăngz stimz nyâuđ cloo Zâu cuungv, yaz nyăngz pyây lâyc six max nyâyh tuz phătc luungđ tiny. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Ha nâyx six ayx laix heh? Yaz six nongc stimz nyâuđ cloo Zâu, yâuc nongc pyây lâyc nyâyh cloo Zâu. Yaz nongc stimz nyâuđ ayx nzungz, yâuc nongc pyây lâyc nyâyh ayx nzungz. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Năngđ coong nyâuh cungb nongc Stimz nyâuđ tanv Zâu cuungv, wax đomc stâuđ wa cah đi nyăngz munh laiv hayh cloon nyâuh songc coong “A-meen” yămz nyâuh sâuf hâuđ nyăngz jau heh, wâyc stiz max pâyz tuz nyâuh coong luungđ? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Max cun nyâuh sâuf hâuđ nyăngz wac six senz gongx, yâuc max hayh stăngc tuz pitc lanh munh. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Yaz sâuf hâuđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh, wâyc yaz coong pitc huungđ wac năngx đuungx quaix nyâuh tinyh đoih, <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />six yămz jiux pangx cah njaf, yaz nođ coong pyaz zâux mungv tuz saz nyăngz wac nongc nzaox phunz munh, lôx năngx gongx têx coong ah panc zâux wac njingc.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Yâuf pez lex, nyâuh nyâyh nyăngz jau six gâyf ayx cayx năngđ munh sây nâyx. Six yămz ayx huđ nyăngz jau oix zuc ayx cayx năngđ munh sây, nzof yămz nyâyh nyăngz jau six oix zuc ayx cayx năngđ munh côx nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />Yămz gâyf njanh naih ja coong:</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 14:21">“Zâu coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">‘Yaz six nongc</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">coong wac njingc nyăngz munh, yâuc nongc pitc stingx munh nyăngz nzetx coong phunz nâyx stingx munh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">six hănđ nâyx, stiz lauf max mungv Yaz.’”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Wâyc nây, wax đomc wac njingc six nongc ayx ah huungđ njih hoouđ, max zâyf phunz zen nyăngz munh, six phunz max zen nyăngz munh; nzof tâuc wac six max zâyf phunz max zen nyăngz munh, six phunz zen nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Ha, năngđ coong lomc jiux pangx căpx dlonf yămz ah cuyb tinc bix tinyh đoih coong wac njingc, bix naih tongh hangh munh max six max zen nyăngz munh nzac taih mungv, stiz six max zâyf coong nyâuh vutx nâyx haz? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Six năngđ coong tinyh đoih tâuc wac, bix naih max zen nyăngz munh max six tongh hangh nyăngz munh nzac taih, wax tauh munh six tuz numđ nyâuh coong nyăngz wac nzopb tauv nănh, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />yămz nănh nyăngz nyâuđ njaf pinyx vâyv nyăngz jau yâuc tuz coong setb taih, năngđ nâyx, nănh songđ puc nzac paix Zâu Tênb-Huungh, yâuc coong “Zâu Tênb-Huungh senz cloon nyâuh yămz.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Năngđ nây, yâuf pez lex? Nyâuh căpx dlonf nyăngz săngx huđ, laiv lanh naih nzungz, naih wac nzaox, naih phătc hinđ yangh nyăngz jau, naih coong wac njingc, max six naih hayh phanv wac. Oix zuc ayx muif huungđ taih nongc zâyv jiux pangx. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Năngđ coong naih munh coong wac njingc, muif hâyđ cungb tuz iz max six pôz lanh coong, ah lanh coong tuz nyâyc lanh mănc coong, nzof ah lanh six zuc phanv setb taih. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Nzof năngđ coong max naih mănv hayh phanv tuz, wax lanh munh six oix zuc meengx stinyb njâuh yămz wa jiux pangx. Six plănc taih, oix zuc cănh coong ănz nănh yâuc cloon Zâu Tênb-Huungh coong. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Wax đomc tuz sâuđ nyâyc tâuc wac nyăngz munh, lauf phanv phunz iz max six pôz lanh coong, nzof năngx naih wax munh six oix zuc zah mangc. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Six, năngđ coong stâyv mungv nyăngz munh tuz hinđ phunz phătc tix huungđ têx, coong wac đangc wax tauh six zuc sec wac. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Wâyc tinyh đoih six oix zuc săngh lanh săngh lanh têx tâuc wac, phunz muif lanh hayh tuz hoođ pâyz yâuc muif lanh tuz oonz nyâuđ. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Wax đomc tâuc wac munh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ six buc wax đomc tâuc wac munh. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Wâyc Zâu Tênb-Huungh six max zâyf lunc laoc nyăngz Zâu, six peengh oonz nyăngz Zâu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Cayx năngđ yămz wax đomc đăngb zeengh munh nyăngz muif nomz jiux pangx nâyx, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />munh nzif six oix zuc stinyb njâuh yămz wa jiux pangx. Stiz max tuz coong wac, six oix zuc mungv wac, cayx năngđ gâyf njanh coong nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Six năngđ coong stiz oix hoođ pâyz tix huungđ, stiz six oix zuc yămz wa pyau naic cănh nyăngz langh, wâyc munh nzif yămz wa jiux pangx coong wac senz nyayz nzongf. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ha Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz wac six tăng nyâuh taih mah? Max six Nănh nyăngz wac cungb taih yămz nyâuh cuungv heh?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh stunx nănh six tâuc wac munh, max six naih Singx-Lingh yenv nyăngz munh, wax lanh munh six oix zuc pâyz tuz coong, yaz ja phunz nyâuh nâyx đomc wac six Zâu nyăngz lanyf. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Six năngđ coong laiv lanh max nyenc năngđ nâyx, six phanv dluyh nănh max nyenc.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Wâyc nây, yâuf pez lex, oix zuc caođ tuz hayh tâuc wac, yâuc năngx gâyf cangđ munh coong wac njingc. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Six oix zuc ayx muif huungđ năngx hoopđ yâuc ayx năngx naih stâuv ninyh.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Yâuf pez lex yaz coong phunz nyâuh pâyz tauv yaz nzônh phunz nyâuh nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, six nyâuh jinh đangh stipx, yâuc stâuđ tăngđ yămz nyăngz Cuđ Jenx, <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />yâuc păngc nây cuđ jenx nyâuh bix tuz njâuv, tinyh phanv nyâuh nzac jab nzauf yaz nzaox phunz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf năngx sen, năngđ max zâyf nâyx, nyâuh zen six max setb laiv huungđ. <verse eid="1CO 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nzof yămz yaz nzaox phunz nyâuh nyăngz gâyf, six lauf yaz stipx nyăngz gâyf — nây six Zâu Jix-Tuz tayc wâyc pănh nyăngz stoif âyz năngđ Canyx Stâub coong nyăngz wac, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />Nănh zuc plopx tauv tah stamz noib yâuc tuz săngh taih cayx năngđ Canyx Stâub coong nâyx, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />Nănh hinđ setb taih phunz Sê-pha, zef hinđ phunz wa săpc nyâyc lanh cumh pâuz munh. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Blătc quaix đangz, Nănh yâuc toongx ah hâyđ hinđ phunz ngâuf pez đuungx lanh munh phătc, wax đomc munh naih đuungx lanh nâyx zanyf lauf năngx jinh săngh, six naih ah phanx mâyc njoomh blătc nzof. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Blătc wa, Nănh zef hinđ phunz Ya-coopc, zef hinđ phunz wax đomc muif lanh cumh pâuz munh. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Tăng wa, blătc wax đomc munh, tauv cah đangz wax hâyđ nănh zef hinđ phunz yaz phătc, ayx cayx năngđ cay yaz six steengb stâyv đangz wax tauh sây đany. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Wâyc yămz wax đomc cumh pâuz munh yaz six năngx jenz quaix, yaz yâuc max payh tuz hipđ ayx cumh pâuz munh, wâyc yaz ayx huđ ănz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz jiux pangx. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Six păngc Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pôz yaz bix tuz năngđ nâyx zanyf, nzof Nănh nyăngz pôz yămz yaz six max zâyf coong max setb laiv huungđ. Plănc taih, yaz yâuc ayx cumh pâuz năngx zâuđ têx wax đomc muif lanh munh, six max zâyf cănh yaz, nây six Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz pôz cloon yaz yămz. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Wâyc nây, hănđ six yaz max six wax đomc munh, buz lauf nzaox năngđ nâyx, nzof nyâuh lauf zen năngđ nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Ha, năngđ coong Zâu Jix-Tuz tuz nzônh coong, Nănh tuz ayx tăng tayc săngh taih, năngđ nâyx săngh laix nyâuh bix naih ah phanx yâuc coong, munh tayc max hayh săngh taih, nâyx heh? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Năngđ coong munh tayc max hayh săngh taih, six njinh cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz six lauf max tuz săngh taih; <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />nzof năngđ coong Zâu Jix-Tuz max tuz săngh taih, têx buz nzaox nyăngz jau six max setb laiv huungđ, nzof nyâuh zen nyăngz jau lauf max setb laiv huungđ. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Nzof buz yâuc cayx năngđ cay puv maoh ayx zanyx manyf phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nâyx, wâyc buz ayx zanyx manyf coong Zâu Tênb-Huungh ayx phunz Zâu Jix-Tuz săngh taih, wâyc nây, năngđ coong munh tayc bix max hayh săngh taih, Zâu Tênb-Huungh lauf max ayx phunz Zâu Jix-Tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Wâyc zuc năngđ coong munh tayc max tuz săngh taih, six njinh cloon Zâu Jix-Tuz lauf max tuz săngh taih, <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />nzof năngđ coong Zâu Jix-Tuz max tuz săngh taih, têx nyâuh nyăngz zen stimz six max setb laiv huungđ; nyâuh six lauf năngx jinh zuc yămz nyâuh nyăngz stoif cah đi. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Nzof mâyc njoomh yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz wax đomc munh six lauf zuc mêtc. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Năngđ coong pănh nyăngz njih mungc yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz bix cungb yămz nây yangh stâyv cuungv, têx pănh six săngh năngx stanc quaix yămz nây bamh canz nyăngz munh tauv laiv wax đomc.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Six nâyx zanyf, Zâu Jix-Tuz tuz ayx tăng tayc săngh taih, ayx zetx toongv săngh taih nyăngz munh, yămz wax đomc mâyc njoomh nyăngz munh tauv laiv. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Wâyc zuc tăng ah lanh munh bix naih zuc tayc, six lauf tăng ah lanh munh bix tuz tăng tayc săngh taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Wâyc tăng A-đam, muif lanh munh bix zuc tayc ayx năngđ laix, six lauf năngđ wa nâyx, yămz Zâu Jix-Tuz muif lanh munh six tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Six mănv yâuc cănh tuz âyz mănv nyăngz phănc: Zâu Jix-Tuz six ayx zetx toongv; tauv Zâu Jix-Tuz taih nyăngz săngx huđ, lêpc Nănh wax đomc munh zef tuz săngh taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Tăng wa, tauv stêtb mâyv noib, Nănh six jaoz côkz phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh six Pha, yămz Nănh mêtc nzuf ayx huungh cun cloon naih lanyf naih jab tauv laiv wax đomc nyăngz săngx huđ. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Wâyc Nănh six ayx huungh cun tuz tauv laiv zanyf Nănh zoz nzuf wax đomc yônz zaz ănz Nănh nyăngz staux đi. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Tauv stêtb mâyv yônz zaz zuc mêtc nyăngz jau six zuc tayc. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Wâyc “Zâu Tênb-Huungh zoz muif huungđ ănz Nănh nyăngz staux đi.” Six coong tauv coong “Nănh zoz muif huungđ,” six max coong tauv ayx phunz muif huungđ buc Nănh wax Tauh. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Tauv wax zanyf, muif huungđ six zuc buc Nănh nzuf, tauv wa njinh Toonz lauf zuz buc ayx phunz muif huungđ buc Nănh wax Tauh, phunz Zâu Tênb-Huungh six ayx muif huungđ yămz manf dlayc.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Năngđ max zâyf nâyx, bix wax đomc ayx quaix-gâyf tayv phunz munh tayc wax đomc six ayx laix heh? Năngđ coong munh tayc senz max hayh săngh taih, ha săngh laix stiz bix wâyc wax đomc munh ayx quaix-gâyf heh? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Nzof săngh laix buz bix laiv zanyf lauf zuc tanyđ munh ayx huđ ănz? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz muif noib tayc, yaz numđ nyađ nyâuh, wâyc yaz tuz nyâuh yămz pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Năngđ coong âyz bamh munh nyăngz zux ix, yaz lôx cloon yămz wa Ê-phê-sô wax đomc jămx staov yez tinyh bopc nzof gôh, nâyx yaz bix tuz luungđ gongx heh? Năngđ coong munh tayc max tuz săngh taih, six “Phanv nhlinc phanv hopb, wâyc săngh đoomz pănh six tayc.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Nyâuh năngx gâyf bây zuc jaf: “Lah pyeoz toic huđ six ayx phunz stimz gongx nyăngz gao huđ ninyh.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Oix zuc sting điub taih! Yâuf năngx gâyf njinh luh longđ stoif gôh. Wâyc naih ah phanx munh senz max pâyz tauv Zâu Tênb-Huungh ax tiny — Yaz coong nâyx six nongc ayx phunz nyâuh numđ nyayz.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Six, naih munh yâuc coong: “Munh tayc bix săngh taih ayx laix heh, laiv năngx hayh naih stinb nongc săngh taih nzof heh?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Munh oongx munh lex! Mâyh songx nyăngz tax huungđ, năngđ coong max yootz six max hayh săngh tuz. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Nzof mâyh songx nyăngz tax huungđ, six max zâyf lub taih nyăngz miuh, mâyh six cungb songx nhlimb cuungv — cayx năngđ blauh witx max six pitc huungđ nhlimb. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Six Zâu Tênb-Huungh cănh âyz Nănh nyăngz zux ix phunz naih miuh, ah huungđ nhlimb cănh naih ah huungđ miuh. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Max zâyf muif huungđ stinb a six songc ah huungđ a. Bamh munh nyăngz stinb a six cănh njingc, stanyb hauđ nyăngz stinb a lauf cănh njingc, nooc nyăngz stinb a yâuc cănh njingc nzof byauf nyăngz stinb a lauf cănh njingc. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Lauf naih đuungx huungđ hanyh jangx yămz wa cah zâyc guungh nzof cah đi nib lauf naih đuungx huungđ hanyh jangx. Six, guungh nyăngz gwăngz eeng cănh njingc, nzof nib nyăngz gwăngz eeng lauf cănh njingc. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Bah noib nyăngz gwăngz eeng six cănh njingc, lav nyăngz gwăngz eeng lauf cănh njingc, nzof wax đomc stingz tau nyăngz gwăngz eeng lauf max tinyh năngđ. Wâyc nâyx nomz stingz tau cloon wax nomz stingz tau nyăngz gwăngz eeng lauf max tinyh năngđ. <verse eid="1CO 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Munh tayc săngh taih six lauf năngđ nâyx. Zuc plopx nyăngz stinb six hayh yootz, săngh taih nyăngz stinb six max hayh yootz; <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />zuc plopx nyăngz stinb six stanc; tuz săngh taih nyăngz stinb six gwăngz eeng; zuc plopx nyăngz stinb six đoonh, tuz săngh taih nyăngz stinb six njoongh; <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />zuc plopx nyăngz stinb six naih samđ, săngh taih nyăngz stinb six pênx stinz, năngđ coong naih nâyx nomz samđ nyăngz stinb, six lauf naih pênx stinz nyăngz stinb. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />Năngđ nây lauf naih ja coong: “Tah yetx tauh A-đam six pênx săngh nyăngz mengc hoonh.” Tah nyâyc tauh A-đam six stinz sađ phunz naih săngh mengc. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Six max zâyf pênx stinz nyăngz stinb taih đangc, six naih samđ nyăngz stinb taih đangc, tăng wa nzăngđ tauv pênx stinz nyăngz stinb taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Tah yetx tauh munh six tăng nib setb taih, yâuc săngh nib nyăngz munh. Tah nyâyc tauh munh six tăng guungh taih. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Săngh nib nyăngz wax tauh munh ayx năngđ laix, six wax đomc săngh nib nyăngz munh tauv laiv lauf năngđ wa nâyx; nzof săngh wa guungh nyăngz wax Tauh ayx năngđ laix, six wax đomc săngh wa guungh nyăngz munh tauv laiv lauf năngđ wa nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Pănh nzâyz săngh nây nib nyăngz wax tauh nyăngz hanyh jangx ayx năngđ laix, pănh six lauf nzâyz săngh wa guungh nyăngz wax Tauh nyăngz hanyh jangx năngđ wa nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Yâuf pez lex, yaz oix coong manyf nâyx đomc jau coong, naih a naih samđ six max hayh stipx tuz Zâu Tênb-Huungh nyăngz côkz. Hayh huđ yootz nyăngz phănc six max hayh stipx tuz mayv huđ yootz nyăngz phănc. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Mungv bex, yaz phunz nyâuh pâyz tuz ah huungđ max zeengx plongx yangh nyăngz jau: Pănh six max zâyf muif lanh mâyc njoomh nzuf, pănh six muif lanh tuz pyênv wav, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />toongx ah zanyf, cayx năngđ ah nzipx mâyc nâyx, yămz blungh blex stingb buib wax zanyf. Wâyc blungh blex stingb six buib nhlangđ, wax đomc tayc nyăngz munh six tuz săngh taih yămz max hayh yootz nyăngz stinz, nzof pănh tinyh đoih six tuz pyênv wav. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Wâyc nâyx nomz hayh yootz nyăngz stinb six tuz wav pênx max hayh yootz nyăngz stinb, nzof nâyx nomz hayh tayc nyăngz stinb yâuc wav pênx max hayh tayc nyăngz stinb. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Zu tauv laiv zanyf, nâyx nomz hayh yootz nyăngz stinb tuz wav pênx max hayh yootz nyăngz stinb, nzof nâyx nomz hayh tayc nyăngz stinb tuz wav pênx max hayh tayc nyăngz stinb wax zanyf, tuz ja taih nyăngz wac songđ tuz setb taih nzuf, coong:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:54">“Tayc nyăngz jab zuc mêtc nzuf, tuz hingh nyăngz jab songđ cun sen.”<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />“Tayc nyăngz jab lex, mâyh tuz hingh yămz laiv heh?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Tayc nyăngz jab lex, mâyh tôc tayc nyăngz njaiz yămz laiv heh?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Tôc tayc nyăngz njaiz six stoif, nzof stoif nyăngz jab six gâyf njanh. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Six sâuf hâuđ Zâu Tênb-Huungh, Nănh phunz pănh tuz hingh quaix yămz pănh nyăngz Zâu, six Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz! <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Yaz stăngz nzongf nyăngz yâuf pez lex, wâyc nây, oix zuc zen năngx tăngđ, năngx gâyf plungh plănb, oix zuc muif dlih nzac jab ayx Zâu nyăngz cumh pâuz, wâyc pâyz tuz coong nyâuh wâyc Zâu ayx nyăngz cumh pâuz zâuđ, six max zâyf coong max setb laiv huungđ.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Coong tauv goopx nyanh phunz wax đomc đăngb zeengh munh nyăngz jau, nyâuh oix zuc ayx cayx năngđ cay yaz bux yămz wa Ga-la-ti stâyz phangz, wax đomc jiux pangx ayx nyăngz nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Muif nomz gâyf paix nyăngz tah yetx noib, năngđ coong nyâuh laiv lanh munh tuz sađ phunz laiv huungđ jax dlaih bix cănh ston lanyc nzâyz taih goopx, tauv yaz ninyh wax zanyf, nzăngđ max zâuđ goopx luungđ. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Tauv yaz ninyh, yaz six paiđ nyâuh sên taih nyăngz munh, nzâyz nyâuh goopx taih nyăngz nyanh cloon yaz nyăngz jenx ninyh wa Yê-lu-sa-lem. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Nzof năngđ coong wax cuyb cumh pâuz hoopđ zuc nongc yaz ninyh, stiz six lauf cloon yaz ninyh. <verse eid="1CO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />Six yaz clăngv quaix wa Ma-si-đô-ni stâyz phangz muf tuz. Yaz nzăngđ ninyh nyâuh wa, wâyc yaz zuc clăngv quaix wa Ma-si-đô-ni stâyz phangz muf. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Nzof naih dlih yaz lôx cloon nyâuh yămz wa, max cayb lôx năngx yămz wa tuz blătc guungh song, phunz nyâuh hayh tuz stungx yaz setb jau ninyh, năngđ coong yaz oix quaix laiv ninyh. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Wâyc yaz max zâyf cungb oix pitb wa bix pongh nyâuh cuungv, năngđ coong Zâu phunz, yaz six oix tuz cloon nyâuh yămz wa ah dlapc. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Yaz six năngx yămz wa Ê-phê-sô ayx tuz tauv Pên Tê Coot stêtz, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />wâyc yămz wa naih ah tungđ jeengh lub coib goib phunz yaz nyăngz cumh pâuz, six naih đuungx huungđ yâuc jinh đangh cangđ yaz.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Năngđ coong Ti-mô-tai ninyh tauv wa, oix zuc stipx phunz nănh tuz pungx stimz cloon nyâuh yămz, wâyc nănh six ayx Zâu nyăngz cumh pâuz, cayx năngđ yaz nâyx. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Wâyc nây, năngx gâyf phunz mănv mangc nănh stam. Six oix zuc stăngc nănh tuz peengh oonz setb jau ninyh, phunz nănh hayh tuz lauf pongh yaz, wâyc yaz jinh đangh zu nănh cloon wax đomc yâuf pez lauf. <verse eid="1CO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Năngx naih pănh nyăngz yâuf pez A-bô-lô, yaz quinb bux êu nănh cloon nâyx tauh yâuf pez ninyh nyâuh wa, six nănh nâyx zanyf max zeengx oix ninyh. Zu tauv laiv zanyf naih congv nănh nzăngđ ninyh.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Oix zuc bôngh stimz; nzac jab zen năngx tăngđ; oix zuc tam lub; yâuc njoongh staox. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Nyâuh ayx nyăngz muif huungđ oix zuc naih lanh stăngz lanh.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Six, yâuf pez lex, yaz quinb nyâuh (nyâuh pâyz coong, yămz wa A-ca-ya stâyz phangz six Sa-tê-pha-nat nyăngz pyau munh zen Zâu đangc, stiz yâuc nongc nzuf nyâuđ bokc dlic wax đomc đăngb zeengh munh), <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />nyâuh oix zuc zanyb nâyx đomc munh cloon wax đomc yetx stong songc ayx cumh pâuz zâuđ nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Yaz numđ nyađ Sa-tê-pha-nat, Pho-tu-na-tat, cloon A-cai-cat, wâyc zuc laiv huungđ nyâuh stăngc max tuz tauv, stiz yâuc taih stăngc nzuf; <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />wâyc stiz ayx phunz yaz cloon nyâuh nyăngz stimz nyâuđ tuz numđ naih jab staox. Năngđ nây, oix zuc stipx nyunc wax đomc munh năngđ nâyx.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Yămz Ê-si stâyz phangz wax đomc jiux pangx pungx wac đeh tauv nyâuh, A-qui-la, cloon Bitc-sin-la, cloon yămz stiz nyăngz pyau căpx dlonf nyăngz jiux pangx, numđ nyađ pungx wac đeh tauv nyâuh yămz Zâu cah njaf nyăngz munh. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Yetx stong yâuf pez tinyh đoih đeh tauv nyâuh, oix zuc nongc đăngb zeengh nyăngz tomz lanh đeh lanh.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Nâyx zâux đeh nyăngz wac six yaz cănh nongc puf ja — Phao-lô. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Năngđ coong laiv lanh max lêpc gongx Zâu, wax tauh six zuc zaux! Zâu lex buz joođ Mâyh taih! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Cloo Zâu Yê-su nyăngz pôz cloon nyâuh yămz. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Yaz nyăngz stăngz cloon nyâuh tinyh đoih yămz Zâu Yê-su Jix-Tuz nyăngz cah njaf. A-meen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>